 "_": "Planned V2 listing set: the eighteen stocks listed on the V1 factory, with the V2 parameters of script/RehearseV2Launchpad.s.sol and the gates and sell chunks those V1 listings use today. The default input of tools/v2_launch_check.py until a V2 factory exists; once it does, run the check with --factory and this file supplies only the list of stocks. Every per-stock field carries a source tag, defined in `sources`. `fee` is informational: the check reads the fee tier from the pool itself.",
